# Only the live app (nvn-app/) is tracked.
#
# What follows is the pre-merge scaffolding from May 2026 — the phase-by-phase
# tree that was copied over a fresh Laravel 11 install to produce nvn-app/. It
# is superseded, it is not runnable on its own (see SETUP.md), and tracking it
# invites editing the wrong copy. Still on disk, just not in the repository.
/app/
/bootstrap/
/config/
/database/
/resources/
/routes/
/_integration/
/SETUP.md

# Local Claude Code settings (machine-specific permission grants)
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# The Laravel app carries its own .gitignore at nvn-app/.gitignore, which
# already excludes .env, /vendor, the SQLite database, uploaded documents and
# notary assets under storage/app/private, and the brand uploads in public/brand.
